{"nodes": [{"id": "docs_edullm_team_workflow_quick_start", "label": "eduLLM Team Quick Start Handout", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "docs/edullm-team-workflow.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_edullm_team_workflow_host_checklist", "label": "Host Pre-Meeting Checklist", "file_type": "rationale", "rationale": "Submission must not be announced until PR #14 and #13 merge, the no-compute acceptance test passes, every submitter has Write access to edu-llm/OLMo-core, and at least one enabled operator is on call, so no teammate can create a request that nobody is able to run.", "source_file": "docs/edullm-team-workflow.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_edullm_team_workflow_post_merge_flow", "label": "Post-Merge Request-to-Run Flow", "file_type": "rationale", "rationale": "Push clean non-main commit, invoke /submit-edullm-job, Issue validation assigns an operator and sends Slack, the operator runs edullm run, Slurm executes, W&B and the Issue show results. No pull request, reviewer approval, or PR CI is required to run a job because PRs and future rulesets govern merging to main only; creating the Issue never submits compute.", "source_file": "docs/edullm-team-workflow.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_edullm_team_workflow_branch_requirements", "label": "Teammate Branch and Commit Preconditions", "file_type": "rationale", "rationale": "Work on a non-main branch with origin pointing at the canonical repository, commit code/config/data/metric wiring, keep the tree clean, and push the exact 40-character SHA. Fork-only commits and direct-main SHAs are ineligible because the operator must be able to fetch and pin the exact reviewed object.", "source_file": "docs/edullm-team-workflow.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_edullm_team_workflow_enabled_operators", "label": "Enabled eduLLM Operators", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/edullm-team-workflow.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_edullm_team_workflow_ready_to_run_ordering", "label": "Ready To Run Ordering Rule", "file_type": "rationale", "rationale": "edullm jobs --mine lists assigned requests under 'Ready to run' and later jobs under 'Submitted and recent'. Operators inspect the first, lowest-numbered Ready row because edullm run always submits that request; later Ready rows wait behind it and 'Ready to run (0)' means there is nothing to submit.", "source_file": "docs/edullm-team-workflow.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_edullm_team_workflow_editable_install_requirement", "label": "Editable Install Requirement", "file_type": "rationale", "rationale": "python -m pip install -e . is mandatory because the Skill's validation adapter imports the eduLLM modules from the local checkout before it can preview or create the request Issue; ModuleNotFoundError: edullm is the symptom of skipping it.", "source_file": "docs/edullm-team-workflow.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_edullm_team_workflow_generic_smoke_option", "label": "generic-smoke Engineering Demo Option", "file_type": "rationale", "rationale": "generic-smoke exists only for engineering demonstrations and must never stand in for a scientific hypothesis, comparison, data choice, seed, or metric; the Skill offers it only when the requester explicitly chooses an engineering demo.", "source_file": "docs/edullm-team-workflow.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_edullm_team_workflow_orcd_ssh_session", "label": "Automatic ORCD SSH Session", "file_type": "rationale", "rationale": "The first setup/jobs/run/logs/stop command without a healthy shared ORCD SSH session starts one automatically; the terminal prompts for the ORCD password and Duo approval and eduLLM captures neither credential. Later commands reuse the session for up to one hour, edullm logout closes it immediately, and ssh -MNf orcd-login is the manual fallback.", "source_file": "docs/edullm-team-workflow.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_edullm_team_workflow_wandb_expectations", "label": "Teammate W&B Metric Ownership", "file_type": "rationale", "rationale": "The teammate owns metric wiring and must use /weights-and-biases and push metric changes before submitting when the selected script does not emit the tracked metric. API keys never go in GitHub, Slack, or Git; operator-side credentials perform the run under entity eduLLM and one allowed project.", "source_file": "docs/edullm-team-workflow.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_edullm_team_workflow_operator_demo", "label": "No-Compute Operator Demo", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/edullm-team-workflow.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}], "edges": [{"source": "docs_edullm_team_workflow_quick_start", "target": "docs_edullm_team_workflow_post_merge_flow", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/edullm-team-workflow.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_edullm_team_workflow_quick_start", "target": "docs_edullm_team_workflow_host_checklist", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/edullm-team-workflow.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_edullm_team_workflow_quick_start", "target": "docs_edullm_team_workflow_orcd_ssh_session", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/edullm-team-workflow.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_edullm_team_workflow_host_checklist", "target": "docs_edullm_team_workflow_enabled_operators", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/edullm-team-workflow.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_edullm_team_workflow_post_merge_flow", "target": "docs_edullm_team_workflow_branch_requirements", "relation": "conceptually_related_to", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/edullm-team-workflow.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_edullm_team_workflow_ready_to_run_ordering", "target": "src_edullm_cli_format_operator_jobs", "relation": "references", "confidence": "INFERRED", "confidence_score": 0.95, "source_file": "docs/edullm-team-workflow.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_edullm_team_workflow_ready_to_run_ordering", "target": "src_edullm_jobs_run_assigned", "relation": "references", "confidence": "INFERRED", "confidence_score": 0.95, "source_file": "docs/edullm-team-workflow.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_edullm_team_workflow_ready_to_run_ordering", "target": "src_edullm_cli_handle_jobs", "relation": "references", "confidence": "INFERRED", "confidence_score": 0.85, "source_file": "docs/edullm-team-workflow.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_edullm_team_workflow_orcd_ssh_session", "target": "src_edullm_ssh_sshclient_ensure_master", "relation": "references", "confidence": "INFERRED", "confidence_score": 0.95, "source_file": "docs/edullm-team-workflow.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": 